; Combine with project-publication.cddl and project-snapshot.cddl.
publication-commit = {
  format: "limo-cad-publication-commit",
  version: 1,
  slot: 0 / 1,
  receipt: publication-receipt
}
; Commit <=4096 bytes, recursion <=16, no unknown/duplicate/trailing fields.
; Slot 0/1 names publication-0.cbor / publication-1.cbor, never an input path.
; Writer holds external exclusive owner lease across prepare and commit.
; Write inactive slot, then atomically replace publication-commit.cbor.
; Exact committed retry allowed; same receipt with other content rejects.
; Same owner/incarnation; revision nondecreasing; export sequence increasing.
; Reader: read commit, read slot, reread commit; retry if record differs.
; Exact receipt in capsule must match the stable commit. Never JSON fallback.
; Completed writes retain two capsules and one commit. Atomic-write temp
; files are cleaned on ordinary errors; abrupt process termination may leave
; owned staging files. No broad cleanup is performed by this protocol.
; Power-loss durability is filesystem-dependent.
